<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="2e237cd4">&lt;p&gt;
    Using the environment features, plan the construction of the environment. Work with infrastructure specialists, system
    administrators, network administrators, and application specialists to determine the work effort and dates to construct
    the plan.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Develop draft of environment build plan
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review estimates with appropriate IT personnel
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review plan with project team
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
    Review the plan with the project team and factor in the environment delivery dates into the larger project delivery
    plan.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Update plan after actual environment is built for future reference
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote style=&quot;MARGIN-RIGHT: 0px&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;
        After the environment has been built, update the plan with the actual delivery dates to compare against the
        original estimates. Submit the plan to the firm&apos;s methodology team to enhance procedures for future projects.
    &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;</attribute>
